    "document": "Core Rules",
    "section": "13. Terrain",
    "ruleNumber": "13.09",
    "summary": "Hidden is checked model by model. A qualifying INFANTRY, BEASTS or SWARM model needs a terrain area containing a Light or Dense feature. Its unit must have fired no ranged attacks in either the current or immediately preceding turn. The battle’s opening turn satisfies the preceding-turn test automatically. Hidden limits enemy sight to observers inside the model’s detection range, ordinarily 15 inches. Resolve distance and sight using the general rules.",
